{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41343","headline":"题斗山观 · 王仁裕","name":"题斗山观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞衣欲举醉陶陶，不觉全家住绦霄。\n拔宅只知鸡犬在，上天谁信路岐遥。\n三清辽廊抛尘梦，八景云烟事早朝。\n爲有故林苍柏健，露华凉叶锁金飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}